WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:32.960
(Dragon pot)

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:34.890
This is the legendary cookware dragon pot

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:37.210
that has been sleeping for a thousand years.

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:39.500
It looks solemn,

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:41.600
but a seemingly ordinary pot.

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:47.530
What Shaoan gave me before death

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:49.540
was the last part of my mother's notebook

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:50.520
that was missing.

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:53.040
It records the production method

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:55.060
of the unique chrysanthemum sauce.

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:14.930
This is chrysanthemum sauce.

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:16.090
How come?

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:17.830
It takes half a year

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:18.680
to ferment and mature.

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:20.680
Absolutely right.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:23.480
This is the unique chrysanthemum sauce.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:25.840
So profound,

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:27.160
mild

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:28.120
and charming fragrance.

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:30.600
The legendary dragon pot

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:32.510
is a magical pot

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:33.550
that can gather cosmic energy soon

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:35.050
to make the process of

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:36.370
maturation and fermentation

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:38.280
proceed at an ultra-fast speed.

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.970
Then we heard that there were rumors

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.970
of mysterious cookware in Sichuan.

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:45.570
So we said goodbye to Sanjie.

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:47.370
After leaving Shanghai, we were on a journey

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:48.360
to find the third cookware.

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:56.080
Sanjie, see you.

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:05.490
Save Xie Lu! A Torrent of Noodles!

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:15.980
(Mount Huang, Anhui Province)

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:18.190
What?

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.620
All the travel expenses were stolen?

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:23.570
In the restaurant just now.

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:25.430
I am really sorry.

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:29.220
How come?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:31.290
Fool.

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:36.030
We all have to sleep in the wild

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.900
because of someone.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:39.100
Exactly.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:41.830
Chef Xie shouldn't drink.

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:43.740
Stop saying that.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.700
I'm also reflecting on myself.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.220
Really?

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:53.960
Is this an empty house?

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:55.660
No one seems to live here.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.550
Let's sleep here.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:58.840
It's better than sleeping in the wild.

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:00.020
So lucky.

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:07.400
What are you doing?

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:08.150
Silang.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:08.970
Silang.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:12.350
Stop.

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:14.410
Monkey.

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:17.320
Stop.

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:24.810
Silang.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:27.740
Hello.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:32.200
You bad monkey.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:32.980
Get down.

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.250
What did Wulang do?

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:38.010
Look.

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:39.620
Look at the wound on my face.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:42.270
Silang, we made a mistake.

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:43.950
Sorry.

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:44.800
We shouldn't break into

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:46.160
your house.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:47.570
Not at all.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:48.850
We also broke into

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:51.430
this empty house.

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:53.240
Empty house?

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:57.050
We are wandering acrobatic troupe.

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:58.230
As you see,

00:04:58.280 --> 00:04:59.020
we are home free

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:00.540
and lead a simple life.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:02.040
If you want,

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:04.740
do you want to try our dishes?

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:06.890
But it's only half done.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:08.650
Looks like you are

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:11.190
going to make dumplings, right?

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:12.530
Anything wrong?

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.530
Well.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.120
Okay.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.860
Since we are all wandering around,

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:23.280
I will show my skills tonight

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:25.240
and make you supper.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.010
Chef Xie, I will help you.

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:30.990
With so many ingredients,

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:31.880
there should be no problem.

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:33.950
This is...?

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:38.030
This rock mushroom is rare.

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:41.520
Who are you?

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:43.980
You are wandering acrobatic troupe.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:46.230
And we are wandering chef team.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.980
Unique skill, seven-color dumplings.

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:07.300
Done.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:09.950
So delicious.

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:13.550
I ate it for the first time.

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:15.230
Don't grab it from me.

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:16.540
So delicious.

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:28.710
My head hurts.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.520
You drank so much, Chef Xie.

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:31.420
Drink some water.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.250
Those of the acrobatic troupe

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:34.700
are all gone.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:36.360
They were afraid of waking us up,

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:38.520
so left without saying anything?

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.000
We found him!

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:47.480
What are you doing?

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:48.940
Who are you?

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:51.780
We are the captors of local yamen.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:53.300
If you interfere with official duties,

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.270
you will all be taken back to the yamen

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:55.090
on the same charges.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:56.950
What?

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:57.700
I have a headache

00:06:57.740 --> 00:06:58.980
because of hangover.

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:00.820
Tell me what I did.

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:12.680
This is the man?

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:15.750
Right, Lord Romen.

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:17.240
The man broke into

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:18.470
our house last night.

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:20.120
He not only severely injured the master,

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.840
but also grabbed all the gold jewelry.

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:25.070
Are you kidding?

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:26.500
I was drunk last night.

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:27.760
I slept here all night.

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:30.820
Okay, arrest him on the charge of robbery.

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:32.160
Take him back to yamen.

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:33.740
Wait.

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:35.500
How can you arrest him casually?

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:36.330
It hurts.

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:37.230
What are you doing?

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:38.260
Stop it.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:39.820
Chef Xie has been with us

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:40.340
from last night until now.

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:42.240
Shut up and piss off.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.300
What happened?

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.010
I don't know anything.

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:51.570
Set me free.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.050
I am afraid I can't.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.170
The robber criminal is him.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:56.930
We have witnesses.

00:07:57.060 --> 00:07:59.020
You should check it out.

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:01.880
How many times should I say?

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.090
You beard.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:07.100
I will arrest you for slander.

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:12.280
Lord Romen.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:13.970
Chef Xie will

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:15.150
never be a robber.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:17.400
The prisoner must be someone else.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:20.500
Then bring that person to me.

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.760
Hold on, Lord Romen.

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:26.080
I forgot to tell you.

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:27.100
In this place,

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:28.960
the crime of robbery is a capital crime.

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:31.320
Capital crime?

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:34.060
At five o'clock this evening,

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.220
this robber

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:36.960
will be executed by myself.

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:39.410
Capital crime?

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:40.750
How come?

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:42.530
You didn't even investigate.

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:49.450
Lei En.

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:51.880
The prisoners must be the Acrobatic Troupe.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.440
I have to catch them

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:54.720
to prove Chef Xie's innocence.

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:55.780
No way, Lei En.

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:56.620
You don't even know

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:57.920
where they are.

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:00.760
I have to look for them.

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:02.140
Hold on, Lei En.

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:05.200
If so, look for them in Mount Huang.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:07.720
Why, Mao?

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:09.190
It occurred to me that

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:12.010
they have rock mushrooms.

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:14.090
Mount Huang is rich in rock mushrooms.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:16.980
Rock mushrooms are on the cliffs.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.090
It must be collected by monkeys.

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:20.520
They do have a monkey.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:21.850
Hateful monkey.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:23.060
It makes sense.

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:25.420
Maybe they really hide there.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:27.610
Okay, Mao.

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:28.990
I'll leave it to you here.

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:34.690
Lei En, be careful.

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:36.740
Sir, wait a moment.

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:38.250
Isn't it too hasty

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.110
to execute today?

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.150
Adjutant, why don't you understand?

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:44.770
We have got

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:46.130
the witness testimony.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:49.450
You don't investigate recently,

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:52.320
and are anxious to execute by yourself.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.190
Is there any reason?

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:56.060
What do you mean?

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.660
Before the execution,

00:09:57.710 --> 00:09:59.440
should we investigate clearly?

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.130
You are just an adjutant.

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:02.410
How dare you be so arrogant in front of me?

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:03.280
If you are so capable,

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:04.790
go and see if the execution ground is ready.

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:10.540
I wonder

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:12.630
why are you so clear about cooking.

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:15.060
Yes, I am learning to cook everywhere.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:16.800
Look at the master.

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:18.370
Chef Xie is about to be executed.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:19.780
He is still in the mood to cook.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.130
There are only five hours left

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:22.940
before the execution.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.170
What to do?

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:42.310
Rock mushrooms.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:44.120
Although in Mount Huang,

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:45.190
rock mushrooms only grow in clusters

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:46.610
in a fixed area.

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:47.540
I am almost there.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:55.250
Here?

00:11:02.670 --> 00:11:03.880
What acrobatic troupe?

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:05.900
So this is their true colour.

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:12.920
Good for you to find this place.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:15.770
As long as we sacrifice a companion,

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.970
all of us will be able to survive.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:45.470
Go to hell.

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:51.960
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:01.580
The sentence will be executed in 20 minutes.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.930
It's absolutely helpless now.

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:05.630
Why hasn't Lei En come back yet?

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:07.010
It's too late.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:10.550
Chef Xie is going to be executed.

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:11.550
Silang.

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:16.490
What's that sound?

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:23.560
What is he doing?

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:25.540
Chef Xie is going to be executed.

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:26.720
He is still cooking noodles.

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:27.990
What do you mean?

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:30.160
Even Soul-Repose Noodle won't work.

00:12:30.210 --> 00:12:31.050
Master.

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:34.760
I will save Chef Xie.

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:37.810
Use a method that only we can do.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.600
What do you mean?

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:52.910
Lord Romen, it's time.

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:55.860
You fool.

00:12:55.980 --> 00:12:56.500
Go check it out.

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:59.230
You will know that I am innocent.

00:12:59.280 --> 00:12:59.900
Bad guy.

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:02.130
What are you doing?

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:03.320
See how I fix you.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.380
We are finally looking for cookware.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.990
I am sorry to all.

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.910
Does it really work?

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:22.620
It doesn't seem to.

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:36.040
This is...?

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:37.720
Do you want to take a try?

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:42.330
Why are you cooking ramen?

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:43.220
Lord Romen.

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:44.780
It's time for execution.

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:45.900
Go to the execution ground.

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:47.910
Can you be quiet?

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:50.320
Give it to me.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:53.120
Give me that ramen.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:01.780
Chicken bone stock with black vinegar.

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.620
Spicy seasoning.

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.160
Constantly kneading

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:07.150
makes noodles full of elasticity.

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:09.790
It must be the best.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.470
Please give me another bowl.

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:14.890
OK, please come to this room

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:15.780
to enjoy your meal.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.180
This way, please.

00:14:18.610 --> 00:14:20.630
You will give me then,

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:21.500
right?

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:26.040
Hurry up.

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.400
Okay, coming soon.

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:29.050
Sorry for letting you wait.

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:35.850
It's iced and sweet

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.280
coconut milk noodle soup.

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:39.400
It's so delicious.

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:41.230
This is so little.

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:43.230
I want more.

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:45.080
Give me one more bowl.

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:46.100
Much more.

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:48.180
Got it.

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:49.970
Please hold on.

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:51.610
Okay, I will.

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:53.700
I can wait for a few hours.

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:14.740
Lord Romen.

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:17.660
Time for execution...

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:21.330
So noisy.

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:23.100
Shut up.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.320
Are you ready, Meili and Silang?

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:27.970
I am ready.

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:29.150
Me too.

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:31.810
Here you are, bearded man.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:33.090
Hurry up.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:34.790
Okay.

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:48.540
Colorful noodles with many flavors.

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:51.030
Noodles, keep coming.

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:52.260
Okay.

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:53.200
Bad beard.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:54.460
It seems that he got hooked.

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:56.260
Then I can buy more time.

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.250
Master was in the kitchen

00:15:58.360 --> 00:15:59.780
to find out

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:01.270
what he likes to eat.

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:03.070
Five kinds of noodles and soups.

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:05.570
Plus a combination of various seasonings.

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:08.080
Dozens of flavors of noodles.

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:09.750
In this way, Lord Romen's appetite

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:11.210
can be constantly aroused.

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:12.810
He will keep eating

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:13.400
without getting tired of it.

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:15.950
There are a lot more.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.140
Are you ready?

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.700
Okay, come on.

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.800
This is my special noodle.

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:26.850
(Chameleon Noodle Tower)
Chameleon Noodle Tower.

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:28.490
(Chameleon Noodle Tower)
Coming.

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:32.300
Sir.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:33.800
He deserves to be a super chef.

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:35.520
We can buy more time.

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:38.280
Lei En, come back soon.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.950
Why does it take so much time?

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:44.210
He is already more than an hour late.

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:46.930
You fools.

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.320
Don't be self-righteous.

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.600
I'm innocent.

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:51.440
Be quiet.

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:00.040
What's wrong

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:03.690
I am full.

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:06.030
I'm very satisfied.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:07.510
Thank you for your hospitality.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.620
But I can't eat anymore.

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:12.930
You can eat more, Lord Romen.

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:14.790
Yes, Lord Romen.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.710
You still have a lot to eat.

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:17.470
Yes.

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:18.890
It's just about to start now.

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:21.670
I have a delicious noodle.

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:22.790
Take more.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:26.290
You are the accomplices

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:27.810
of the robber.

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:31.270
What's wrong with me?

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:33.010
I was caught in

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:35.240
their procrastination tactics.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:37.200
Lord Romen, hold on.

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:38.000
Shut up.

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:40.020
I will arrest you for the crime

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:41.570
of obstructing official duties.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:44.060
How come?

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:58.660
It's hopeless.

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:00.600
Lei En can't make it.

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:02.230
Chef Xie.

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:05.930
Chef Xie.

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:09.670
Chef Xie.

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:10.980
Silang.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:11.760
Silang.

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:13.660
You should be ready.

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:17.110
I won't make you suffer.

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:19.970
I will kill you neatly.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.050
We are about to start.

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:27.220
Chef Xie.

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:36.050
What?

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.960
What do you want to do?

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:49.650
Is that okay, sir?

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:50.810
What?

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:54.180
Shouldn't you cut off my head?

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:57.940
Chef Xie.

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:01.760
Then who is this guy?

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:09.900
Sir, you obviously confuse me

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:12.160
with this person just now.

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:14.070
Did you understand?

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:16.610
The witness also

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:17.550
confused me with him

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:19.830
just like you.

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:21.010
That's to say,

00:19:21.060 --> 00:19:22.190
he is the real prisoner.

00:19:22.630 --> 00:19:24.540
He is the leader of Mount Huang's thieves.

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:26.070
He deliberately pretended to be

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:27.130
me who was about his size.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:29.650
He took an iron rod to rob

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.040
to plant the crime on me.

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:35.860
These jewels

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:37.730
are part of stolen goods

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.000
found in their lair.

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:42.110
It seems that I was so hasty

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.090
and made a wrong judgment.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.140
Give it to me.

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:47.120
I'll kill the real prisoner.

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:48.980
Wait.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:55.490
What do you want?

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:56.170
Let go.

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:58.210
There is one more prisoner.

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:01.050
This man is an important witness

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:02.490
of this fact.

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:05.170
I won't let you kill him, sir.

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:07.660
What are you talking about?

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.340
Catch him, Adjutant.

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:18.220
Lord Romen.

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:20.170
Do you still want to pretend?

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:21.520
Adjutant.

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:23.290
Lord Romen.

00:20:23.810 --> 00:20:25.500
These Mount Huang's thieves

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:27.390
have all told the truth.

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:30.780
You instruct them to rob,

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:33.260
and then use your position

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:34.870
to cover all crimes.

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:35.990
In other words,

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:38.040
You are the real manipulator

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:39.780
of these Mount Huang's thieves

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:40.820
How come?

00:20:40.890 --> 00:20:41.800
Nonsense.

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:42.560
We investigated these

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:44.480
Mount Huang's thieves long ago.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.060
Today we met Lei En in their lair.

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:49.570
So we brought the arrested prisoner

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.160
to replace Chef Xie.

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:55.450
Fortunately, the execution time

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:56.570
was delayed.

00:20:58.740 --> 00:21:00.180
Going back and forth in the steep Mount Huang

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:03.170
within half a day is so tiring.

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:04.400
Mao.

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:05.310
Lei En.

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:06.150
Lei En.

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:08.060
Lei En. You made it.

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:10.660
Mao's delaying tactics worked.

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:12.870
Master, great.

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:15.430
Great.

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:16.460
No.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:17.580
I don't know them.

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:19.590
They have nothing to do with me.

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:21.860
If you have anything to say,

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:24.060
say it in the Governor's Mansion.

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:25.320
Take him away.

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:30.410
Chef Xie, you are fine. Great!

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:31.180
Mao.

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:32.570
Chef Xie.

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:35.150
I worried you all.

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:37.540
Mao, Silang, meili

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:38.530
and Lei En.

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:39.520
Thank you.

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:42.200
I owe you a lot.

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:46.390
Thanks to your procrastination noodles.

00:21:46.600 --> 00:21:47.100
Mao.

00:23:14.976 --> 00:23:16.979
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.793 --> 00:23:20.849
What? This little bastard is a divine chef?

00:23:21.122 --> 00:23:24.593
However, this guy's pot was
truly a miracle in the making.

00:23:24.593 --> 00:23:27.181
Maybe it's the third Legendary Cooking Utensil?

00:23:27.668 --> 00:23:29.030
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.483 --> 00:23:32.116
Demogorgon
Miracle of Demon Saint Bronze.

00:23:32.289 --> 00:23:33.521
It will definitely be interesting!
